        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A superb, architecturally designed detached 4 bed residence situated in a prime position in one of the most sought-after locations in West Cork.\r\n\r\nThis exceptional property has been finished to an extremely high standard, combining generous proportions, high-quality materials and thoughtful architectural design throughout. Features include high ceilings, quality doors, premium flooring and carefully selected finishes.\r\n\r\nUpon entering the property, you are welcomed by a large and impressive entrance hallway, setting the tone for the quality and space found throughout the home. The open plan living/kitchen/dining area is bright and airy with its floor to ceiling windows. Opening out to the large rear terrace, it brings the outside in, ideal for those long summer days and entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe property offers four spacious bedrooms, two of which boast stylish en-suite shower rooms and walk-in wardrobes. Conveniently, one of the ensuite bedrooms is located on the ground floor. On the first floor, two bedrooms have access to the balcony terrace, a perfect spot for a morning cuppa while watching the world go by. \r\n\r\nEvery aspect of the house has been carefully considered, with an emphasis on comfort, energy efficiency and modern living.\r\n\r\nSurrounding the property, you have a parking area to the front, the wonderful large paved terrace and landscaped garden areas with a variety of shrubs, plants and hedging. An extra benefit is the second rear entrance with an additional parking area.\r\n\r\nLocated within the popular coastal village of Schull, this property is just a short walk from the Main Street and pier area. Schull is well known for its excellent schools, charming shops and range of bars, restaurants and cafés. It is also renowned for its sailing and maritime heritage, attracting many enthusiasts to its safe harbour and its world-class sailing school. Cork Airport is approx. 90 mins’ drive.\r\n\r\nThis is an exceptionally high-end home, presented in excellent condition and maintained to a very high standard. Architecturally designed, energy efficient and finished with quality throughout, it represents a rare opportunity to acquire a truly outstanding residence in one of West Cork’s most desirable locations.\r\n\r\nAccommodation:\r\n\r\nGround Floor\r\n\r\nLiving Room: 5.6m x 5.7m. \r\nAccess to terrace, stove. \r\n\r\nKitchen: 3.4m x 3.3m. \r\nFitted kitchen with integrated appliances.\r\n\r\nDining Area: 5.3m x 2.1m. \r\nFloor to ceiling windows, access to terrace\r\n\r\nBedroom 4: 4.8m x 3.3m. \r\n\r\nEnsuite Wet Room: 3m x 1.7m. \r\nWc, wash hand basin & shower. \r\n\r\nWalk in Wardrobe: 1.5m x 1.4m. \r\n\r\nShower Room: 3.5m x 1.8m. \r\nWc, wash hand basin & shower. \r\n\r\nUtility Room: 4.7m x 3.2m. \r\nPlumbed for washer/dryer, sink, fitted wall & floor units. \r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom: 5.9m x 3.6m. \r\nBuilt in wardrobe. \r\n\r\nEnsuite: 2.6m x 1.5m. \r\nWc, wash hand basin & shower. \r\n\r\nWalk in Wardrobe: 2.3m x 1.4m. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2: 4.9m x 4.6m. \r\nBuilt in wardrobe, access to balcony.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: 5.3m x 4.7m. \r\nAccess to balcony.\r\n\r\nBathroom: 4.2m x 1.8m. \r\nWc, wash hand basin, shower & separate bath. \r\n\r\nAiring Cupboard: 3m x 1.5m. \r\n\r\nServices: \r\nMains water & sewerage\r\nOil-fired central heating\r\nHigh speed fibre broadband\r\n\r\nBER Details:\r\nBER: B\r\nBER No: 119855393\r\nEPI: 94.82 kWh/m2/yr"
      },
